<section class="why-deskpaws" id="why">
  <div class="why-inner">
    <div class="why-header reveal-up">
      <div class="section-label">— Why DeskPaws</div>
      <h2 class="section-heading">Built for bond.<br><em>Designed for focus.</em></h2>
    </div>

    <div class="why-grid">
      <div class="why-card reveal-card" style="--delay:0s">
        <div class="why-card-icon">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 64 64" fill="none">
            <circle cx="32" cy="32" r="30" fill="#FDF3E8"/>
            <path d="M20 36 C20 28 26 22 32 20 C38 22 44 28 44 36 C44 42 40 46 32 48 C24 46 20 42 20 36Z" fill="#E8924A" opacity="0.2"/>
            <path d="M32 20 C32 20 26 26 26 32 C26 38 32 44 32 48 C32 44 38 38 38 32 C38 26 32 20 32 20Z" fill="#E8924A" opacity="0.3"/>
            <circle cx="32" cy="34" r="8" fill="#E8924A"/>
            <path d="M28 30 Q32 26 36 30" stroke="white" stroke-width="2" fill="none" stroke-linecap="round"/>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3>Reduces cat anxiety</h3>
        <p>Proximity to you calms separation stress. Cats sleep deeper when they can hear your presence — at desk level, not the floor.</p>
        <div class="why-stat">
          <span class="stat-num" data-count-to="87">0</span><span class="stat-sym">%</span>
          <span class="stat-desc">of cats showed calmer behavior within 7 days</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="why-card why-card--featured reveal-card" style="--delay:0.1s">
        <div class="why-card-icon">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 64 64" fill="none">
            <circle cx="32" cy="32" r="30" fill="#FDF3E8"/>
            <rect x="14" y="24" width="36" height="4" rx="2" fill="#E8924A"/>
            <rect x="22" y="28" width="4" height="16" rx="2" fill="#C4956A"/>
            <rect x="38" y="28" width="4" height="16" rx="2" fill="#C4956A"/>
            <ellipse cx="32" cy="44" rx="14" ry="6" fill="#D4A870"/>
            <circle cx="28" cy="41" r="2.5" fill="#2D1B0E"/>
            <circle cx="36" cy="41" r="2.5" fill="#2D1B0E"/>
            <ellipse cx="32" cy="45" rx="1.5" ry="1" fill="#E8924A"/>
            <text x="18" y="22" font-family="DM Mono, monospace" font-size="7" fill="#8B6340">DESK</text>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <div class="featured-tag">Most loved</div>
        <h3>Zero floor disturbance</h3>
        <p>No more cat on the keyboard. No more blocked monitors. Your cat stays contained in their dedicated zone — right where the magic happens.</p>
        <div class="why-stat">
          <span class="stat-num" data-count-to="94">0</span><span class="stat-sym">%</span>
          <span class="stat-desc">fewer keyboard interruptions reported</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="why-card reveal-card" style="--delay:0.2s">
        <div class="why-card-icon">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 64 64" fill="none">
            <circle cx="32" cy="32" r="30" fill="#FDF3E8"/>
            <path d="M22 44 L22 28 Q22 20 32 20 Q42 20 42 28 L42 44" stroke="#E8924A" stroke-width="2.5" fill="none" stroke-linecap="round"/>
            <circle cx="32" cy="30" r="6" fill="#E8924A" opacity="0.3"/>
            <!-- Safety lock -->
            <rect x="26" y="36" width="12" height="10" rx="2" fill="#E8924A"/>
            <circle cx="32" cy="42" r="2" fill="white"/>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3>Safety-tested &amp; certified</h3>
        <p>Load-tested to 36 lbs (3× max rating). Non-slip silicone pads grip your desk without scratching the surface finish.</p>
        <div class="why-stat">
          <span class="stat-num" data-count-to="36">0</span><span class="stat-sym"> lbs</span>
          <span class="stat-desc">maximum tested load capacity</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="why-card reveal-card" style="--delay:0.3s">
        <div class="why-card-icon">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 64 64" fill="none">
            <circle cx="32" cy="32" r="30" fill="#FDF3E8"/>
            <path d="M20 32 C20 24 26 18 32 18 C38 18 44 24 44 32" stroke="#E8924A" stroke-width="2.5" fill="none" stroke-linecap="round"/>
            <circle cx="22" cy="33" r="3" fill="#E8924A"/>
            <circle cx="42" cy="33" r="3" fill="#E8924A"/>
            <!-- Air flow arrows -->
            <path d="M28 38 Q32 42 36 38" stroke="#C4956A" stroke-width="2" fill="none" stroke-linecap="round"/>
            <path d="M26 44 Q32 50 38 44" stroke="#C4956A" stroke-width="2" fill="none" stroke-linecap="round" opacity="0.6"/>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3>360° ventilated weave</h3>
        <p>Natural rattan promotes airflow from all sides. Your cat stays cool in summer and the open weave prevents overheating.</p>
        <div class="why-stat">
          <span class="stat-num" data-count-to="100">0</span><span class="stat-sym">%</span>
          <span class="stat-desc">natural rattan — zero synthetic plastics</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="why-card reveal-card" style="--delay:0.4s">
        <div class="why-card-icon">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 64 64" fill="none">
            <circle cx="32" cy="32" r="30" fill="#FDF3E8"/>
            <path d="M32 14 L34.5 22.5 L43.5 22.5 L36.5 27.5 L39 36 L32 31 L25 36 L27.5 27.5 L20.5 22.5 L29.5 22.5 Z" fill="#E8924A"/>
            <circle cx="32" cy="45" r="5" fill="#E8924A" opacity="0.3"/>
            <path d="M29 45 L31 47 L35 43" stroke="#E8924A" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3>30-day happiness guarantee</h3>
        <p>If your cat doesn't take to it within 30 days, return it — no questions, no restocking fees, full refund.</p>
        <div class="why-stat">
          <span class="stat-num" data-count-to="30">0</span><span class="stat-sym"> days</span>
          <span class="stat-desc">full money-back guarantee period</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="why-card reveal-card" style="--delay:0.5s">
        <div class="why-card-icon">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 64 64" fill="none">
            <circle cx="32" cy="32" r="30" fill="#FDF3E8"/>
            <path d="M16 28 L22 34 L32 22" stroke="#E8924A" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
            <path d="M32 34 L38 40 L48 26" stroke="#E8924A" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" opacity="0.5"/>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3>Ships in 100% recycled packaging</h3>
        <p>Every box is recycled and recyclable. Your order ships carbon-neutral and arrives with a plant-a-tree certificate.</p>
        <div class="why-stat">
          <span class="stat-num" data-count-to="100">0</span><span class="stat-sym">%</span>
          <span class="stat-desc">recycled and carbon-neutral packaging</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{% schema %}
{ "name": "Why DeskPaws", "settings": [] }
{% endschema %}
